                "label": "Media Complicity and Pseudoscience Promotion",
                "description": "Mass media outlets frequently glorify supernatural sensationalism and UFO conspiracies while ignoring rigorous scientific skepticism. Commercial incentives drive broadcasters to market uncritical credulity because irrational drama generates higher ratings."
