                "id": "compassionate-skepticism",
                "label": "Compassionate and Respectful Skepticism",
                "description": "Skeptics must not ridicule people holding unscientific beliefs, but instead approach them with empathy and understanding. Effective education requires recognizing that supernatural longings often stem from profound human emotional and psychological needs."
